{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/028e918850755e78a5eb2ef6681e1cdb.poster.avif?t=1767345413\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/028e918850755e78a5eb2ef6681e1cdb.webm?t=1767345413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/339c9e491ec166b878ba6ec09c422e01.apng?t=1767345413\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/339c9e491ec166b878ba6ec09c422e01.poster.avif?t=1767345413\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=52 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform between human soldier and demonic entity as you fight through hostile alien worlds. <i>Two Sides of Hell</i> delivers intense twin-stick action where mastering both forms is the key to survival against hordes of extraterrestrial abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a breath of fresh air from traditional modern gameplay, with original twin-stick &amp; no-mouse-required controls that go back to the roots of video game history while delivering cutting-edge roguelite depth across procedurally generated alien hellscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/1082af4cacc284adf4de22f9e98c57ab.avif?t=1767345413\" width=616 height=318 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/2c64e03ee23a46dc1e0d9b17f2fbb369.webp?t=1767345413\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip through alien hordes as both man and monster. Master both forms to unleash precision gunfire or demonic fury, chaining kills in relentless twin-stick chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/8e2af3a50af3d84b316f44db06ee93b4.poster.avif?t=1767345413\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/8e2af3a50af3d84b316f44db06ee93b4.webm?t=1767345413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/8e2af3a50af3d84b316f44db06ee93b4.mp4?t=1767345413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/5e63b6829149b152a243631774559233.webp?t=1767345413\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic arcade action reborn: twin-stick gunplay meets side-scrolling mayhem in a no-mouse required experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/315c82f5158d27d75006383f0df3b14c.avif?t=1767345413\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run throws you into shifting alien arenas packed with unpredictable enemies and ruthless bosses \u2014 no two battles the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/7dcc65b5b0ae4996dc09bb1195a51ed1.avif?t=1767345413\" width=616 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/fac8234dee0403e699edca57d8ba1896.poster.avif?t=1767345413\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/fac8234dee0403e699edca57d8ba1896.webm?t=1767345413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/fac8234dee0403e699edca57d8ba1896.mp4?t=1767345413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/34ef3d5767c2d24f5f6f59715a71fb8e.webp?t=1767345413\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run writes a new ending. Your skill, your choices, your survival decide how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/554de21586b2ed9b3366a30a40fae2a5.webp?t=1767345413\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the chaos coming with permanent upgrades and run-changing consumables that supercharge your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/6468402192c07a3daf38b161803d3ad8.poster.avif?t=1767345413\" width=614 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569650/extras/6468402192c07a3daf38b161803d3ad8.webm?t=1767345413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com